1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:03,600
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Sharon Carter wanted to take a pottery class.

2
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:06,020
She didn't want to go alone.

3
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:09,040
She invited her husband to go with her.

4
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:12,240
I don't want to do that, said Mr.

5
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:12,700
Carter.

6
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:14,920
Pottery is for girls.

7
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:17,960
This made Sharon very angry.

8
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:20,800
She could not believe he said that.

9
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:25,140
That's a sexist thing to say, yelled Sharon.

10
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:28,120
She argued with him for hours.

11
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:31,200
Mr. Carter was tired of fighting.

12
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:34,720
He agreed to go just to shut Sharon

13
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:35,220
up.

14
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,280
Their first class went very well.

15
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:42,120
Mr. Carter was really good at making pots.

16
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:44,860
The instructors loved him.

17
00:00:45,540 --> 00:00:48,320
You are very talented, they all said.

18
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:52,560
Mr. Carter went to pottery class every week

19
00:00:52,560 --> 00:00:53,260
after that.

20
00:00:53,820 --> 00:00:54,920
He loved it!
